<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Sunday's final matches:</p>
<p>25 - Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>23 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>18 - Robbie Fowler (Liverpool), Ole Gunnar Solksjaer</p>
<p>(Manchester United) 17 - Dwight Yorke (Aston Villa)</p>
<p>16 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough), Les Ferdinand</p>
<p>(Newcastle)</p>
<p>13 - Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton)</p>
<p>12 - Stan Collymore (Liverpool), Steve Claridge (Leicester),</p>
<p>Dennis Bergkamp (Arsenal), Juninho (Middlesbrough)</p>
</text>
